Z||000000||Philphine||01-28-2001||12:56 PM||||<BR>popular hotrodding, sept. 2000. not much but maybe someone with the know how can use it. '58 chevy wagon wth a northstar engine. they used an '82 camaro cpu, "radically tweaked", with a painless wiring harness. thats all they say about it.<P>i know there have been a few discussions on what computer to use. all of it went over my head, but if this helps bring it back. i'm willing to be confused if theres some understanding later.||||reg||1
