Z||000008||Will||01-29-2001||11:10 AM||||I *think* that an Aurora chip ($34) will run a Northstar if the fuel pressure is turned up (Northstars have adjustable fuel pressure regulators stock!). Will be testing that hypothesis in a couple of months. The two cars use the same ECM, but the Aurora chip doesn't have all the interaction BS that makes the Caddy electronics so hard to use.<BR>||||reg||1
